{"id":"t1360677","key":"the devil s climb|2024","csv":{"title":"The Devil's Climb","year":2024,"directors":["Renan Ozturk Drew Pulley"],"rating":6,"watchedDate":"2026-07-31"},"status":"ok","tmdb":{"tmdbId":1360677,"imdbId":"tt33406376","wikidataId":"Q131549922","title":"The Devil's Climb","originalTitle":"The Devil's Climb","altTitles":[],"tagline":"","overview":"Alex Honnold et Tommy Caldwell, deux grimpeurs d'élite et amis proches, entreprennent une expédition audacieuse en Alaska. Leur défi : parcourir 4000 kilomètres à vélo avant d'escalader le Devil's Thumb, un pic vertigineux de 2700 mètres isolé dans la forêt sauvage. L'aventure s'annonce particulièrement périlleuse pour Tommy, récemment remis d'une grave blessure qui avait menacé sa carrière d'alpiniste.","overviewLang":"fr","releaseDate":"2024-10-17","runtime":75,"status":"Released","genres":["Documentaire","Aventure"],"genreIds":[99,12],"countries":["United States of America"],"originCountry":["US"],"languages":["English"],"originalLanguage":"en","directors":["Renan Öztürk"],"directorIds":[1123183],"writers":[],"composers":[],"cinematographers":[],"editors":[],"producers":[],"cast":[{"id":107800,"name":"Alex Honnold","character":"Self","profilePath":"/jKpVo1wTFK7VoCULHFKpoxDgHRw.jpg"},{"id":107798,"name":"Tommy Caldwell","character":"self","profilePath":"/jEGsQatwOpN3Cy24y8pBZI4bctS.jpg"}],"companies":["National Geographic","Plimsoll Productions"],"collection":null,"keywords":["extreme sports","climbing","alaska","sports documentary","alpine climbing","mountain climber","rockclimbing","breaking barriers in rock climbing"],"certificationFR":null,"certificationUS":null,"budget":null,"revenue":null,"popularity":2.0114,"voteAverage":7.6,"voteCount":37,"adult":false,"posterPath":"/qjecaspP70FPUL8G6TxzKYplDw3.jpg","backdropPath":"/iSh1Bc8uhcFjnJbJdN8EN6MOYRn.jpg","homepage":null,"social":{"facebook":null,"instagram":null,"twitter":null}},"extra":{"credits":{"cast":[{"id":107800,"name":"Alex Honnold","original_name":"Alex Honnold","character":"Self","order":0,"gender":2,"known_for_department":"Acting","profile_path":"/jKpVo1wTFK7VoCULHFKpoxDgHRw.jpg"},{"id":107798,"name":"Tommy Caldwell","original_name":"Tommy Caldwell","character":"self","order":1,"gender":2,"known_for_department":"Acting","profile_path":"/jEGsQatwOpN3Cy24y8pBZI4bctS.jpg"}],"crew":[{"id":1123183,"name":"Renan Öztürk","original_name":"Renan Öztürk","job":"Director","department":"Directing","gender":2,"profile_path":"/8n6t81MDM1CGmdACuqDV6AtjJFV.jpg"}]},"alternativeTitles":[],"externalIds":{"imdb_id":"tt33406376","wikidata_id":"Q131549922","facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"keywords":[{"id":2006,"name":"extreme sports"},{"id":8624,"name":"climbing"},{"id":9880,"name":"alaska"},{"id":159290,"name":"sports documentary"},{"id":221117,"name":"alpine climbing"},{"id":318854,"name":"mountain climber"},{"id":322235,"name":"rockclimbing"},{"id":349938,"name":"breaking barriers in rock climbing"}],"releaseDates":[{"iso_3166_1":"BR","release_dates":[{"certification":"14","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"Disney+","release_date":"2025-04-23T00:00:00.000Z","type":4}]},{"iso_3166_1":"SG","release_dates":[{"certification":"PG13","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"Disney+","release_date":"2024-10-18T00:00:00.000Z","type":4}]},{"iso_3166_1":"US","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"en","note":"","release_date":"2024-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","type":1}]}],"translations":[{"iso_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"English","english_name":"English","title":"","overview":"Climbers Alex Honnold and Tommy Caldwell set out on a daring expedition to tackle Alaska's formidable Devils Thumb. Battling harsh conditions and daunting peaks, they push their physical and mental limits, while their deep friendship faces its toughest trial yet.","tagline":"Hell isn't below, it's 9000 feet above."},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"魔鬼攀登","overview":"登山者Alex Honnold和Tommy Caldwell踏上了征服阿拉斯加危险的魔鬼拇指的探险之旅，在险峻的山峰上挑战极限，同时他们牢不可破的纽带也受到了终极考验。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"fi","iso_3166_1":"FI","name":"suomi","english_name":"Finnish","title":"Paholaisen huipun valloitus","overview":"Alex Honnold ja Tommy Caldwell ovat kaksi kaikkien aikojen suurinta kiipeilijää – ja parhaita ystäviä. He lähtevät eeppiselle seikkailulle, jossa he pyöräilevät 4000 kilometrin matkan kiivetäkseen Devil's Thumbille, joka on legendaarinen, vanhan sademetsän ympäröimä yli 2 700 metriä korkea huippu Alaskassa. Tommy toipuu uraansa uhkaavasta vammasta, mikä tekee retkikunnan onnistumisesta epävarmaa.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"The Devils Thumb - Ein höllischer Aufstieg","overview":"Alex Honnold und Tommy Caldwell zählen zu den besten Kletterern aller Zeiten – und darüber hinaus sind sie beste Freunde. Gemeinsam brechen die beiden nun zu einem epischen Abenteuer auf: Nach einer über 4.000 Kilometer langen Extrem-Fahrradtour wollen sie an der Grenze zwischen Alaska und der kanadischen Provinz British Columbia den 2.700 Meter hohen Devil’s Thumb bezwingen. Der Weg zum Gipfel führt das Bergsteiger-Duo durch uralte Wälder und faszinierende Wildnis. Doch eine Verletzung Tommys droht den Erfolg der Expedition zu gefährden.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"ES","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"El ascenso del diablo","overview":"Los escaladores Alex Honnold y Tommy Caldwell emprendieron una atrevida expedición para enfrentarse al formidable Devils Thumb de Alaska. Luchando contra duras condiciones y picos desalentadores, superan sus límites físicos y mentales, mientras su profunda amistad enfrenta la prueba más dura hasta el momento.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ru","iso_3166_1":"RU","name":"Pусский","english_name":"Russian","title":"Восхождение на Палец Дьявола","overview":"Палец Дьявола - зловещие башни из покрытых льдом черных скал. Альпинисты Алекс Хоннольд, хорошо известный нам по фильму \"Фри-соло\", и его друг Томми Колдуэлл отправляются в экспедицию на Аляску, чтобы покорить эту жуткую вершину. Во время этого опасного восхождения альпинисты не только испытали свои силы, но и проверили насколько крепки их дружеские отношения. Ведь единственное, что помогает в горах не погибнуть - это доверие к своему напарнику и лучшему другу.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"hu","iso_3166_1":"HU","name":"Magyar","english_name":"Hungarian","title":"Megmászni az ördög hegyét","overview":"A látványos dokumentumfilmben Alex Honnold és Tommy Caldwell, napjaink két élő hegymászó-legendája a lehetetlenre vállalkozik: a határaikat feszegetve megkísérlik egy nap alatt meghódítani a 2700 méteres hírhedt alaszkai masszívum, a Devils Thumb mind az öt csúcsát. Útjuk során azonban nemcsak a jeges környezet, a függőleges sziklafalak és a szélsőséges időjárás jelent nehézséget a duó számára, de Tommy közelmúltbeli súlyos Achilles-ín sérülése is, ami a szokottnál is bizonytalanabbá teszi az expedíció sikerét.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pl","iso_3166_1":"PL","name":"Polski","english_name":"Polish","title":"Wyprawa na Devil's Thumb","overview":"Wspinacze Alex Honnold i Tommy Caldwell wyruszają na odważną wyprawę, aby pokonać potężny Devils Thumb na Alasce. Walcząc z trudnymi warunkami i odstraszającymi szczytami, przekraczają swoje granice fizyczne i psychiczne, podczas gdy ich głęboka przyjaźń staje w obliczu najtrudniejszej próby.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"cs","iso_3166_1":"CZ","name":"Český","english_name":"Czech","title":"Výstup na Devils Thumb","overview":"Sledujeme dva z nejlepších horolezců všech dob, Alexe Honnolda a Tommyho Caldwella, kteří se rozhodli pro výstup na Devils Thumb, legendární 2767 metrů vysoký vrchol obklopený aljašskou divočinou. Tommy se ale zotavuje ze zranění, které ohrožuje jeho kariéru, a není jisté, jestli plánovaná expedice bude úspěšná.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pt","iso_3166_1":"BR","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","title":"Devil's Thumb: Escalada Perigosa","overview":"Alex Honnold e Tommy Caldwell são dois dos maiores escaladores de todos os tempos - e melhores amigos. Juntos, eles embarcam em uma aventura épica, pedalando 4.000 quilômetros rumo à ousada escalada da Devil's Thumb, uma lendária montanha de 2.700 metros no Alasca cercada por uma antiga floresta tropical. Tommy está se recuperando de uma lesão que ameaçou sua carreira, tornando incerto o sucesso da expedição.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"FR","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"","overview":"Alex Honnold et Tommy Caldwell, deux grimpeurs d'élite et amis proches, entreprennent une expédition audacieuse en Alaska. Leur défi : parcourir 4000 kilomètres à vélo avant d'escalader le Devil's Thumb, un pic vertigineux de 2700 mètres isolé dans la forêt sauvage. L'aventure s'annonce particulièrement périlleuse pour Tommy, récemment remis d'une grave blessure qui avait menacé sa carrière d'alpiniste.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"tr","iso_3166_1":"TR","name":"Türkçe","english_name":"Turkish","title":"Şeytana Karşı","overview":"Tüm zamanların en büyük dağcılarından ikisi, Alex Honnold ve Tommy Caldwell, Alaska'nın vahşi doğasıyla çevrili, 2.767 metre yüksekliğinde efsanevi bir zirve olan “Devil's Thumb”a tırmanmak için yola çıkıyor. İddialı tırmanışa ekstra stres ekleyen Tommy, kariyerini tehdit eden bir sakatlıktan kurtulmaya çalışmaktadır ve bu da tırmanışı daha başlamadan durdurabilir. İkilinin dostluğuna ve zorlu yolculuğuna tanıklık ediyoruz.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ro","iso_3166_1":"RO","name":"Română","english_name":"Romanian","title":"Ascensiunea","overview":"Alex Honnold și Tommy Caldwell sunt doi dintre cei mai buni alpiniști ai tuturor timpurilor - și prieteni la cataramă. Împreună, cei doi pornesc într-o aventură legendară, străbătând pe bicicletă 4.000 km pentru a încerca o îndrăzneață escaladă a muntelui Devil's Thumb, un pisc de 2.767 m din Alaska înconjurat de o pădure seculară. Dar Tommy se recuperează după o accidentare care i-ar putea pune în pericol cariera și succesul acestei expediții.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"TW","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"魔鬼攀登","overview":"美國國家地理頻道聯手美國迪士尼 Disney+ 原創攀岩紀錄片。忠實呈現全球最頂尖攀岩者美國亞歷克斯·霍諾德 (Alex Honnold ) 和湯米·考德威爾 (Tommy Caldwell ) 創全球紀錄，首度征服美國阿拉斯加州超級陡峭岩壁魔鬼拇指山 (Devils Thumb)，令人嘆為觀止。其高超拍攝技巧和扣人心弦的劇情使其獲得高度評價。此紀錄片不僅展現了人類克服自然挑戰的非凡毅力，也突顯了人與自然和諧共處的重要性。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"sv","iso_3166_1":"SE","name":"svenska","english_name":"Swedish","title":"","overview":"Alex Honnold och Tommy Caldwell är två av tidernas främsta bergsklättrare, tillika bästa vänner. Tillsammans cyklar de 400 mil för att bestiga Devils Thumb: En legendarisk bergstopp på 3 000 meter i Alaska, omgiven av gammal regnskog. Tommy håller fortfarande på att återhämta sig efter en karriärshotande skada, vilket gör expeditionens utgång oviss.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ar","iso_3166_1":"SA","name":"العربية","english_name":"Arabic","title":"تسلق ديفلز ثامب","overview":"ينطلق المتسلقان أليكس هونولد وتومي كالدويل في رحلة استكشافية لغزو جبل ديفلز ثامب الغادر في ألاسكا، ويدفعان حدود قدراتهما من خلال تسلقات محفوفة بالمخاطر عبر قمم شاهقة، بينما يتم وضع رابطتهما التي لا تنفصم على الاختبار النهائي.","tagline":""}],"videos":[{"key":"XD_PZVMuJy8","site":"YouTube","type":"Trailer","name":"The Devil’s Climb | Official Trailer | National Geographic","iso_639_1":"en","official":true,"published_at":"2024-09-24T15:59:48.000Z","size":1080}],"images":{"posters":[{"file_path":"/qjecaspP70FPUL8G6TxzKYplDw3.jpg","width":2000,"height":3000,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/1AVkOt06287PYK3xck3hf9PcEgm.jpg","width":2000,"height":3000,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/lSrf8inz2Q3WzBw0D9hkU7Sxe3e.jpg","width":1997,"height":2939,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0.166,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/scQoATJTarEmoVkCVaq